{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/lcv298bm","slide":14,"name":"fighter-two","text":"public int MakeDamage(Random random)\n{\n    return random.Next(Attack - 2, Attack + 3);\n}\n\npublic void TakeDamage(int damage)\n{\n    Hp -= damage;\n    if (Hp < 0) Hp = 0;\n}\n\npublic bool UsePotion()\n{\n    if (!Items.Contains(\"Potion\")) return false;\n\n    Hp += 10;\n    if (Hp > MaxHp) Hp = MaxHp;\n    Items.Remove(\"Potion\");\n    return true;\n}","textPreview":"public int MakeDamage(Random random) | { |     return random.Next(Attack - 2, Attack + 3); | } |  | public void TakeDamage(int damage) | ...","textChars":340,"textLines":20,"bbox":[62,148,760,490]}
